  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health System Modernization Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objectives of this project are (i) to improve the capacity of the MOH and HII to effectively formulate and implement health policies and reforms in provider payments, monitoring and quality assurance, (ii) to improve both the access to, and quality of, primary health care services, with an emphasis on those in poor and under-serviced areas, and (iii) to improve governance and management in the hospital sector.</narrative>
  </description>
